# Exception: a fitted-parameter file, not build output. It is the single
# source of truth for the WAIS S1 quadratic (a, v, H0), written by
# component_wais.ipynb and read by component_projections.get_s1_quadratic().
# Tracking it is the point -- it keeps a refit reviewable as a diff and
# lets a fresh clone run the WAIS tests.
!slr_forecast/notebooks/s1_quadratic_fit.json

